    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0008:0003",
      "blockId": "paragraph:discussion:0008",
      "type": "sentence",
      "source": "ARKit generates environment textures during an AR session using camera imagery, allowing SceneKit or a custom-rendering engine to provide realistic image-based lighting for virtual objects in your AR experience.",
      "normalizedSource": "ARKit generates environment textures during an AR session using camera imagery, allowing SceneKit or a custom-rendering engine to provide realistic image-based lighting for virtual objects in your AR experience.",
      "sourceHash": "82335bcf07eaefd11424ae151fea9a2c168b4fb9e87d2e0a876eca7322a5a4f7",
      "translatable": true,
      "contextBefore": "In 3D asset rendering, environment textures are the basis for image-based lighting algorithms where surfaces can realistically reflect light from their surroundings.",
      "contextAfter": "To enable texture map generation for your configuration, change this property (from its default value of [`ARWorldTrackingConfiguration.EnvironmentTexturing.none`](arworldtrackingconfiguration/environmenttexturing-swift.enum/none.md)):",
      "documentTitle": "ARWorldTrackingConfiguration.EnvironmentTexturing",
      "framework": "ARKit",
      "ko": "ARKit는 AR 세션 중 카메라 영상을 사용해 환경 텍스처를 생성하며, 이를 통해 SceneKit 또는 사용자 정의 렌더링 엔진이 AR 경험의 가상 객체에 사실적인 이미지 기반 조명을 제공할 수 있습니다.",
      "status": "machine_translated",
      "reviewed": false,
      "locked": false,
      "translatedAt": "2026-05-13T00:00:26.986Z",
      "translator": "codex-cli-oauth"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0009:0001",
      "blockId": "paragraph:discussion:0009",
      "type": "sentence",
      "source": "To enable texture map generation for your configuration, change this property (from its default value of [`ARWorldTrackingConfiguration.EnvironmentTexturing.none`](arworldtrackingconfiguration/environmenttexturing-swift.enum/none.md)):",
      "normalizedSource": "To enable texture map generation for your configuration, change this property (from its default value of [`ARWorldTrackingConfiguration.EnvironmentTexturing.none`](arworldtrackingconfiguration/environmenttexturing-swift.enum/none.md)):",
      "sourceHash": "865f51b389712f8ed6a2d6579b9e827d93391518aa25d285d6d1e5a20a9bb6cf",
      "translatable": true,
      "contextBefore": "ARKit generates environment textures during an AR session using camera imagery, allowing SceneKit or a custom-rendering engine to provide realistic image-based lighting for virtual objects in your AR experience.",
      "contextAfter": "With [`ARWorldTrackingConfiguration.EnvironmentTexturing.manual`](arworldtrackingconfiguration/environmenttexturing-swift.enum/manual.md) environment texturing, you identify points in the scene for which you want light probe texture maps by creating [`AREnvironmentProbeAnchor`](arenvironmentprobeanchor.md) objects and adding them to the session.",
      "documentTitle": "ARWorldTrackingConfiguration.EnvironmentTexturing",
      "framework": "ARKit",
      "ko": "구성을 위해 텍스처 맵 생성을 사용 설정하려면 이 속성을 기본값인 [`ARWorldTrackingConfiguration.EnvironmentTexturing.none`](arworldtrackingconfiguration/environmenttexturing-swift.enum/none.md)에서 변경해야 합니다.",
      "status": "machine_translated",
      "reviewed": false,
      "locked": false,
      "translatedAt": "2026-05-13T00:00:26.986Z",
      "translator": "codex-cli-oauth"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:list:discussion:0010:0001",
      "blockId": "list:discussion:0010",
      "type": "list_item",
      "source": "With [`ARWorldTrackingConfiguration.EnvironmentTexturing.manual`](arworldtrackingconfiguration/environmenttexturing-swift.enum/manual.md) environment texturing, you identify points in the scene for which you want light probe texture maps by creating [`AREnvironmentProbeAnchor`](arenvironmentprobeanchor.md) objects and adding them to the session.",
      "normalizedSource": "With [`ARWorldTrackingConfiguration.EnvironmentTexturing.manual`](arworldtrackingconfiguration/environmenttexturing-swift.enum/manual.md) environment texturing, you identify points in the scene for which you want light probe texture maps by creating [`AREnvironmentProbeAnchor`](arenvironmentprobeanchor.md) objects and adding them to the session.",
      "sourceHash": "1946b8ee05d70feca57fefce32f92fec303dc3cafc647d0cf821a7bd992fa880",
      "translatable": true,
      "contextBefore": "To enable texture map generation for your configuration, change this property (from its default value of [`ARWorldTrackingConfiguration.EnvironmentTexturing.none`](arworldtrackingconfiguration/environmenttexturing-swift.enum/none.md)):",
      "contextAfter": "With [`ARWorldTrackingConfiguration.EnvironmentTexturing.automatic`](arworldtrackingconfiguration/environmenttexturing-swift.enum/automatic.md) environment texturing, ARKit automatically creates, positions, and adds [`AREnvironmentProbeAnchor`](arenvironmentprobeanchor.md) objects to the session.",
      "documentTitle": "ARWorldTrackingConfiguration.EnvironmentTexturing",
      "framework": "ARKit",
      "meta": {
        "marker": "- "
      },
      "ko": "[`ARWorldTrackingConfiguration.EnvironmentTexturing.manual`](arworldtrackingconfiguration/environmenttexturing-swift.enum/manual.md) 환경 텍스처링을 사용하면, [`AREnvironmentProbeAnchor`](arenvironmentprobeanchor.md) 객체를 생성해 세션에 추가하여 장면에서 라이트 프로브 텍스처 맵을 생성할 지점을 지정합니다.",
      "status": "machine_translated",
      "reviewed": false,
      "locked": false,
      "translatedAt": "2026-05-13T00:00:26.986Z",
      "translator": "codex-cli-oauth"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:list:discussion:0010:0002",
      "blockId": "list:discussion:0010",
      "type": "list_item",
      "source": "With [`ARWorldTrackingConfiguration.EnvironmentTexturing.automatic`](arworldtrackingconfiguration/environmenttexturing-swift.enum/automatic.md) environment texturing, ARKit automatically creates, positions, and adds [`AREnvironmentProbeAnchor`](arenvironmentprobeanchor.md) objects to the session.",
      "normalizedSource": "With [`ARWorldTrackingConfiguration.EnvironmentTexturing.automatic`](arworldtrackingconfiguration/environmenttexturing-swift.enum/automatic.md) environment texturing, ARKit automatically creates, positions, and adds [`AREnvironmentProbeAnchor`](arenvironmentprobeanchor.md) objects to the session.",
      "sourceHash": "fbb8cfbabef9930f004b9412d32feeb83d2b2e290f42d1882062c4e3a9df4e1d",
      "translatable": true,
      "contextBefore": "With [`ARWorldTrackingConfiguration.EnvironmentTexturing.manual`](arworldtrackingconfiguration/environmenttexturing-swift.enum/manual.md) environment texturing, you identify points in the scene for which you want light probe texture maps by creating [`AREnvironmentProbeAnchor`](arenvironmentprobeanchor.md) objects and adding them to the session.",
      "contextAfter": "In both cases, ARKit automatically generates environment textures as the session collects camera imagery.",
      "documentTitle": "ARWorldTrackingConfiguration.EnvironmentTexturing",
      "framework": "ARKit",
      "meta": {
        "marker": "- "
      },
      "ko": "[`ARWorldTrackingConfiguration.EnvironmentTexturing.automatic`](arworldtrackingconfiguration/environmenttexturing-swift.enum/automatic.md) 환경 텍스처링에서는 ARKit가 세션에 [`AREnvironmentProbeAnchor`](arenvironmentprobeanchor.md) 개체를 자동으로 생성하고 배치하며 추가합니다.",
      "status": "machine_translated",
      "reviewed": false,
      "locked": false,
      "translatedAt": "2026-05-13T00:00:26.986Z",
      "translator": "codex-cli-oauth"
