    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0011:0001",
      "blockId": "paragraph:discussion:0011",
      "type": "sentence",
      "source": "In both cases, ARKit automatically generates environment textures as the session collects camera imagery.",
      "normalizedSource": "In both cases, ARKit automatically generates environment textures as the session collects camera imagery.",
      "sourceHash": "b5aa86e571055c69e68c6f1a09cbc11ec653f6b3c34a5a5ab409f5bf27a8a4df",
      "translatable": true,
      "contextBefore": "With [`ARWorldTrackingConfiguration.EnvironmentTexturing.automatic`](arworldtrackingconfiguration/environmenttexturing-swift.enum/automatic.md) environment texturing, ARKit automatically creates, positions, and adds [`AREnvironmentProbeAnchor`](arenvironmentprobeanchor.md) objects to the session.",
      "contextAfter": "Use a delegate method such as [`session(_:didUpdate:)`](arsessiondelegate/session(_:didupdate:)-3qtt8.md) to find out when a texture is available, and access it from the anchor’s [`environmentTexture`](arenvironmentprobeanchor/environmenttexture.md) property.",
      "documentTitle": "ARWorldTrackingConfiguration.EnvironmentTexturing",
      "framework": "ARKit",
      "ko": "두 경우 모두 세션이 카메라 이미지를 수집할 때 ARKit가 환경 텍스처를 자동으로 생성합니다.",
      "status": "machine_translated",
      "reviewed": false,
      "locked": false,
      "translatedAt": "2026-05-13T00:00:26.986Z",
      "translator": "codex-cli-oauth"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0011:0002",
      "blockId": "paragraph:discussion:0011",
      "type": "sentence",
      "source": "Use a delegate method such as [`session(_:didUpdate:)`](arsessiondelegate/session(_:didupdate:)-3qtt8.md) to find out when a texture is available, and access it from the anchor’s [`environmentTexture`](arenvironmentprobeanchor/environmenttexture.md) property.",
      "normalizedSource": "Use a delegate method such as [`session(_:didUpdate:)`](arsessiondelegate/session(_:didupdate:)-3qtt8.md) to find out when a texture is available, and access it from the anchor’s [`environmentTexture`](arenvironmentprobeanchor/environmenttexture.md) property.",
      "sourceHash": "ba634e69b63ece30330ff1397d198e70a63ce3f2cefd0383c4c791aba76e2852",
      "translatable": true,
      "contextBefore": "In both cases, ARKit automatically generates environment textures as the session collects camera imagery.",
      "contextAfter": "If you display AR content using [`ARSCNView`](arscnview.md) and the [`automaticallyUpdatesLighting`](arscnview/automaticallyupdateslighting.md) option, SceneKit automatically retrieves [`AREnvironmentProbeAnchor`](arenvironmentprobeanchor.md) texture maps and uses them to light the scene.",
      "documentTitle": "ARWorldTrackingConfiguration.EnvironmentTexturing",
      "framework": "ARKit",
      "ko": "[`session(_:didUpdate:)`](arsessiondelegate/session(_:didupdate:)-3qtt8.md)와 같은 delegate 메서드를 사용해 텍스처 사용 가능 시점을 확인하고, 앵커의 [`environmentTexture`](arenvironmentprobeanchor/environmenttexture.md) 속성에서 이를 가져올 수 있습니다.",
      "status": "machine_translated",
      "reviewed": false,
      "locked": false,
      "translatedAt": "2026-05-13T00:00:26.986Z",
      "translator": "codex-cli-oauth"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0012:0001",
      "blockId": "paragraph:discussion:0012",
      "type": "sentence",
      "source": "If you display AR content using [`ARSCNView`](arscnview.md) and the [`automaticallyUpdatesLighting`](arscnview/automaticallyupdateslighting.md) option, SceneKit automatically retrieves [`AREnvironmentProbeAnchor`](arenvironmentprobeanchor.md) texture maps and uses them to light the scene.",
      "normalizedSource": "If you display AR content using [`ARSCNView`](arscnview.md) and the [`automaticallyUpdatesLighting`](arscnview/automaticallyupdateslighting.md) option, SceneKit automatically retrieves [`AREnvironmentProbeAnchor`](arenvironmentprobeanchor.md) texture maps and uses them to light the scene.",
      "sourceHash": "3ae9de8346d8503c950e8f36bf24047e76e815390d4a0f84e3ab082dbc947d59",
      "translatable": true,
      "contextBefore": "Use a delegate method such as [`session(_:didUpdate:)`](arsessiondelegate/session(_:didupdate:)-3qtt8.md) to find out when a texture is available, and access it from the anchor’s [`environmentTexture`](arenvironmentprobeanchor/environmenttexture.md) property.",
      "contextAfter": "Topics",
      "documentTitle": "ARWorldTrackingConfiguration.EnvironmentTexturing",
      "framework": "ARKit",
      "ko": "[`ARSCNView`](arscnview.md)와 [`automaticallyUpdatesLighting`](arscnview/automaticallyupdateslighting.md) 옵션을 사용하여 AR 콘텐츠를 표시하면, SceneKit이 [`AREnvironmentProbeAnchor`](arenvironmentprobeanchor.md) 텍스처 맵을 자동으로 검색해 씬을 조명하는 데 사용합니다.",
      "status": "machine_translated",
      "reviewed": false,
